\label{lemma: milnor / insep / insep-iso}
  Let $L|F$ be a finite and purely inseparable extension of fields, such that $\mathrm{Char} F \neq \ell$.
  Then the canonical map $\operatorname{k}^{\rm M}_*(F) \rightarrow \operatorname{k}^{\rm M}_*(L)$ is an isomorphism for all $* \geq 0$.

