  Let $\mathcal{V}$ be a subcategory of $\mathbf{Var}_{k_0}$, and let $\mathcal{U}_1$ and $\mathcal{U}_2$ be two positive-dimensional birational systems, such that $\mathcal{U}_1$ dominates $\mathcal{U}_2$ in $\mathcal{V}$.
